        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur PARPARCOM, Parthenon Decorative Knob And Deadbolt Combo</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe stately ambience of the Parthenon Decorative Knob And Deadbolt Combo makes it a great choice for period style homes or anywhere an opulent look is desired. The beading on the rose, knob, and deadbolt gives the Parthenon Entry Set a classic feel that keeps its finer details from appearing too ornate.  This Grandeur Entry Door Combo Pack includes a high security single cylinder deadbolt meaning it is operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside. The Single Cylinder Parthenon Entry Set With Eden Prairie Knob fits doors 1-3/4” thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. The Parthenon Single Cylinder Combo is forged from solid brass by Grandeur Decorative Door Hardware and has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 10 year finish warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-parthenon-series\"><b>Parthenon Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Parthenon Decorative Knob And Deadbolt Combo:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Parthenon Decorative Knob And Deadbolt Combo:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Parthenon Plate Height: 7.84\"</li>\r\n<li>Parthenon Plate Width: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Parthenon Knob Diameter: 2.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Parthenon Knob Projection: 2.15\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Height: 3.34\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Width: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.52\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder Projection: 0.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4” </li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PAR-plate.pdf?v=1704262179\" target=\"new\"><b>Parthenon Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PAR-knob.pdf?v=1704262179\" target=\"new\"><b>Parthenon Knob Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PAR-deadbolt.pdf?v=1704262179\" target=\"new\"><b>Parthenon Deadbolt Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
